
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Deen Academy | Learn Islam</title>
<style>
:root {
  --green:#0B3B32;
  --gold:#D8B56D;
  --cream:#F7F5EE;
  --white:#FFFFFF;
  --text:#243A32;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{
  margin:0;
  font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
  background:var(--cream);
  color:var(--text);
}
header{
  background:var(--green);
  color:white;
  padding:15px 6%;
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:space-between;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
.brand svg{width:48px;height:48px}
.brand h2{color:var(--gold);font-size:19px}
nav{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
nav button{
  border:0;background:transparent;color:white;
  padding:10px;cursor:pointer;border-radius:8px;
}
nav button:hover{background:#ffffff20}
.hero{
  text-align:center;
  padding:75px 20px;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0B3B32,#195B49);
  color:white;
}
.hero h1{font-size:42px;color:var(--gold)}
.hero p{font-size:17px;line-height:1.7}
.btn{
  background:var(--gold);
  color:#173A2E;
  border:0;border-radius:9px;
  padding:13px 22px;
  font-weight:bold;cursor:pointer;
  margin:7px;
}
section{padding:45px 6%}
h2{color:var(--green)}
.cards{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));
  gap:20px;
}
.card{
  background:white;
  border-radius:15px;
  padding:23px;
  box-shadow:0 5px 18px #00000010;
  border-bottom:3px solid var(--gold);
}
.card h3{color:var(--green)}
.card p{line-height:1.6;color:#66746D}
.icon{font-size:35px}
.page{display:none}
.page.active{display:block}
.hero .btn{margin-top:20px}
.tag{
  display:inline-block;
  background:#F7EED9;
  color:#75551E;
  padding:6px 12px;
  border-radius:20px;
  font-size:12px;
  font-weight:bold;
}
.meeting{
  background:var(--green);
  color:white;
  padding:25px;
  border-radius:15px;
  margin-top:20px;
}
.meeting h3{color:var(--gold)}
input,select{
  display:block;width:100%;
  padding:12px;margin:10px 0;
  border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:8px;
}
footer{
  background:var(--green);
  color:white;
  padding:30px;text-align:center;
}
footer p{color:#E4D9BD}
@media(max-width:600px){
  header{justify-content:center;gap:12px}
  nav{justify-content:center}
  .hero h1{font-size:32px}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="brand">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100">
      <path d="M50 5 L89 28 L89 72 L50 95 L11 72 L11 28Z"
        fill="none" stroke="#D8B56D" stroke-width="3"/>
      <path d="M57 22 C31 20 25 52 42 69
        C55 83 77 73 80 54
        C66 66 47 55 48 39
        C49 31 52 26 57 22Z" fill="#D8B56D"/>
      <path d="M28 76 Q50 60 72 76 M35 82 H65"
        stroke="#D8B56D" fill="none" stroke-width="2"/>
    </svg>
    <h2>DEEN ACADEMY</h2>
  </div>
  <nav>
    <button onclick="show('home')">Home</button>
    <button onclick="show('quran')">Quran</button>
    <button onclick="show('namaz')">Namaz</button>
    <button onclick="show('seerah')">Seerah</button>
    <button onclick="show('courses')">Courses</button>
    <button onclick="show('classes')">Imam Classes</button>
  </nav>
</header>

<main>
<div id="home" class="page active">
  <div class="hero">
    <h1>Welcome to Deen Academy</h1>
    <p>Learn Quran, understand Islam, improve your knowledge<br>
    and grow with guidance from qualified teachers.</p>
    <button class="btn" onclick="show('courses')">Explore Courses</button>
    <button class="btn" onclick="show('classes')">Online Classes</button>
  </div>

  <section>
    <h2>Explore Your Deen</h2>
    <div class="cards">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon">📖</div>
        <h3>Quran Academy</h3>
        <p>Learn Arabic, Quran reading and Tajweed.</p>
        <button class="btn" onclick="show('quran')">Explore</button>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon">🕌</div>
        <h3>Namaz School</h3>
        <p>Learn Wudu and the basics of Salah.</p>
        <button class="btn" onclick="show('namaz')">Explore</button>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon">🌙</div>
        <h3>Seerah</h3>
        <p>Study the life of Prophet Muhammad ﷺ.</p>
        <button class="btn" onclick="show('seerah')">Explore</button>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon">🎓</div>
        <h3>Islamic Courses</h3>
        <p>Structured learning for different levels.</p>
        <button class="btn" onclick="show('courses')">Explore</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<div id="quran" class="page">
<section>
<h2>📖 Quran Academy</h2>
<div class="cards">
<div class="card"><h3>Arabic Letters</h3><p>Learn the Arabic alphabet and pronunciation.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Tajweed</h3><p>Study Quran recitation rules with a teacher.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Surah Learning</h3><p>Study surah meanings using trusted translations.</p></div>
</div>
</section>
</div>

<div id="namaz" class="page">
<section>
<h2>🕌 Learn Namaz</h2>
<div class="cards">
<div class="card"><h3>Wudu</h3><p>Understand preparation and cleanliness before prayer.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Five Daily Prayers</h3><p>Learn about Fajr, Dhuhr, Asr, Maghrib and Isha.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Prayer Basics</h3><p>Study the prayer sequence with a qualified Imam.</p></div>
</div>
</section>
</div>

<div id="seerah" class="page">
<section>
<h2>🌙 Seerah of Prophet Muhammad ﷺ</h2>
<div class="cards">
<div class="card"><h3>Early Life</h3><p>Learn about the early life of the Prophet ﷺ.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Makkah Period</h3><p>Study the beginning of the message in Makkah.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Madinah Period</h3><p>Explore the establishment of the Muslim community.</p></div>
</div>
</section>
</div>

<div id="courses" class="page">
<section>
<h2>🎓 Islamic Courses</h2>
<div class="cards">
<div class="card"><h3>Islamic Basics</h3><p>Introduction to Islamic beliefs and worship.</p><span class="tag">Free introduction</span></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Quran Reading</h3><p>Arabic letters, reading and recitation.</p><span class="tag">Course</span></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Understanding Salah</h3><p>Learn the foundations of daily prayer.</p><span class="tag">Course</span></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Seerah Course</h3><p>Study the life and teachings of the Prophet ﷺ.</p><span class="tag">Course</span></div>
</div>
</section>
</div>

<div id="classes" class="page">
<section>
<h2>👳 Premium Imam Classes</h2>
<p>Learn directly from your Imam through scheduled online meetings.</p>

<div class="cards">
<div class="card">
<h3>📖 Live Quran Classes</h3>
<p>Teacher-guided Quran learning.</p>
<span class="tag">Premium</span>
</div>
<div class="card">
<h3>🕌 Namaz Classes</h3>
<p>Learn prayer with an Imam.</p>
<span class="tag">Premium</span>
</div>
<div class="card">
<h3>🌙 Islamic Studies</h3>
<p>Seerah, Hadith and Islamic knowledge.</p>
<span class="tag">Premium</span>
</div>
</div>

<div class="meeting">
<h3>Student Meeting Area</h3>
<p>Premium students can join their scheduled class here.</p>
<p>Meeting links will be added by the administrator.</p>
<a id="meetingLink" href="#" target="_blank"
rel="noopener noreferrer">
<button class="btn">Join Online Class</button>
</a>
</div>

<div class="card" style="margin-top:20px">
<h3>Class Information</h3>
<p>Contact the academy administrator for class schedules and premium access.</p>
<p>Payments and access verification must be connected to a secure payment and membership service before launch.</p>
</div>
</section>
</div>
</main>

<footer>
<h2 style="color:#D8B56D">DEEN ACADEMY</h2>
<p>Learn • Practise • Grow</p>
<p>Islamic Learning Platform © 2026</p>
</footer>

<script>
function show(id){
 document.querySelectorAll('.page').forEach(p=>{
   p.classList.remove('active');
 });
 document.getElementById(id).classList.add('active');
 window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'smooth'});
}
</script>
</body>
</html>
